{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_797241633#1_1556450607","relevance":3,"reason":"The result directly explains how individuals should handle old electronic devices: wipe personal data, then sell or recycle properly, including returning devices to manufacturer recycling/take-back programs and drop-off sites.","learned":"Individuals should wipe personal data from functional devices, then choose resale or proper recycling such as manufacturer take-back, mail-back, or drop-off programs."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3594","reason":"This query is retrieving directly relevant electronics recycling guidance with concrete disposal steps; continue for more grade-3 documents."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3594"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_828485620#8_1571927929","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3594","rank":2,"snippet":"<cover>Personal Data Client Data Emails 2. Delete All The Files You’ve Backed Up 3. Delete Your Browser Data 4. Deauthorize Your Computer 5. Uninstall Your Programs 6. Securely Wipe Your Hard Drive 7. Give All Old Computers To a Trusted IT Asset Disposition Company for Proper Disposal How to Completely Dispose of Old computers Conveniently With All Green Recycling Let Us Contact You READ THESE SUCCESS STORIES \" , \"segment\": \"For a small fee, such companies take them off your hands ensuring that you have nothing to worry about. How to Completely Dispose of Old computers Conveniently With All Green Recycling Knowing how to completely dispose of old computers on your own is great, but the process is also labor-intensive and stressful. We understand this perfectly and that’s why here at All Green Recycling, we make the entire process as stress-free as possible. We offer a host of computer disposal options including the following: Electronics recycling IT asset remarketing Refurbishing and Repurposing of old computers Secure data destruction services including certificates of destruction, chain of custody and liability, hard drive shredding, and degaussing Our remarketing plan ensures that your organization recoups part </cover>"}}
