{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_34_1377579587#8_2864448346","relevance":3,"reason":"The result directly supports steps for disposing of old electronics: use Earth911 or Greener Gadgets to find recycling options, keep devices out of the trash, cancel unneeded device subscriptions/services, and back up then delete personal data before disposal. It overlaps with an earlier segment from the same article but is still directly relevant.","learned":"Electronics disposal steps include finding local recyclers through Earth911/Greener Gadgets, canceling device-related services, and backing up then deleting personal data before recycling, selling, or donating."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3596","reason":"This query is still yielding grade-3 documents and segments about concrete old-electronics disposal steps; continue until results become irrelevant or exhausted."}}
