{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_20_1076942216#5_2357669890","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of a dedicated e-waste reduction/disposal guide. It directly advises individuals to sell or donate old electronics, clear personal data such as laptop hard-drive data before donating, and recycle/dispose of e-waste properly through brand or EPA-recommended programs.","learned":"Old electronics can be sold or donated, but personal information should be cleared first; devices that are not reused should be recycled or disposed of through proper e-waste programs."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3597","reason":"The query is retrieving relevant e-waste disposal guidance, so continue to look for more grade-3 results, preferably authoritative guidance or distinct pages."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3597"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_15_1675264766#0_3315052198","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3597","rank":3,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_15_1675264766#0_3315052198\" , \"end_char\": 1261.000000 , \"headings\": \"How to Remove Data from Electronics Before Recycling How to Remove Data from Electronics Before Recycling By Kathryn Sukalich Back Up Your Data Use a Data Erasing Program If You’re Still Concerned, Consider Physical Destruction<cover>Recycle or Donate \" , \"segment\": \"How to Remove Data from Electronics Before Recycling | Earth911 EcoTech How to Remove Data from Electronics Before Recycling By Kathryn Sukalich Mar 2, 2016 Ewaste, remove-data-ewaste By recycling one million laptops, we can save the energy equivalent to the electricity used by 3,500 American homes in a year, according to the EPA. </cover>This is one of many good reasons to recycle old electronics, yet recycling rates could be much higher. Only 38 percent of old computers that had reached the end of their useful lives were collected for recycling in 2009, and for cellphones that number was even lower at 8 percent. Data theft concerns are often a roadblock to electronics recycling. Photo: Shutterstock Privacy and data theft concerns are "}}
