{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_15_1675264766#0_3315052198","relevance":3,"reason":"The page is dedicated to removing data from electronics before recycling and provides direct steps: back up data, use a data-erasing program, consider physical destruction if still concerned, then recycle or donate the device.","learned":"Before recycling or donating electronics, individuals should back up files, securely erase data, and consider physical destruction for sensitive storage media if needed."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3597","reason":"The EPA/data query is producing directly relevant electronics disposal and data-removal guidance; continue to find more grade-3 evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3597"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_883613142#2_1781753932","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3597","rank":4,"snippet":"R2 Exit and e-Stewards ® Exit websites to learn how to become a certified electronics recycler. Top of Page How to Find a Certified Recycler For Businesses, Governments and Large Purchasers EPA recommends using certified electronics recyclers to manage unwanted used electronics. Currently, there are two accredited certification standards in the United States: R2 and e-Stewards ®. Both programs advance best management practices and offer a way to assess the environmental, worker health and safety, and security practices of entities managing used electronics. The links below will direct you to websites detailing locations of certified recyclers in these two programs and the services they provide. Examples of services include, but are not limited to, <cover>data security and asset management. e-Stewards ® Exit R2 Exit For Households For households with smaller amounts of used electronics to donate or recycle, you can find collection programs that use certified recyclers by clicking on the links below.\" , \"start_char\": 1700.000000 , \"title\": \"Certified Electronics Recyclers | Sustainable Management of Electronics | US EPA</cover>\" , \"url\": \"https://www.epa.gov/smm-electronics/certified-electronics-recyclers\" }"}}
