{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_883613142#2_1781753932","relevance":3,"reason":"The EPA page is dedicated to certified electronics recyclers and directly supports disposal steps for individuals/households: donate or recycle used electronics through collection programs that use certified recyclers, with attention to data security and responsible management standards such as R2 and e-Stewards.","learned":"Households with used electronics should find donation or recycling collection programs that use certified electronics recyclers, since certification addresses environmental, worker-safety, and data-security practices."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3597","reason":"This query is still producing authoritative, directly relevant electronics recycling/disposal guidance, so continue for more grade-3 results."}}
