{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_50_2670966124#7_3747801629","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of a dedicated guide on what to do before recycling or donating a cell phone. It directly gives disposal-preparation steps such as backing up, signing out, unpairing accessories/devices, removing SIM and memory cards, and factory resetting before recycling or donation.","learned":"Before handing off an old phone, individuals should back up data, sign out, unpair Bluetooth and other connected devices, remove SIM and memory cards, and factory reset before recycling or donating."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3599","reason":"The phone disposal query is producing directly relevant step-by-step guidance; continue to collect additional grade-3 evidence while results remain on target."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3599"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_32_623319114#2_1155987338","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3599","rank":3,"snippet":"aids, may need to be mailed back to the manufacturer for recycling. You may be able to recycle the other types through your local waste management center, or at home improvement or office stores, which often supply drop boxes for battery recycling. Remove batteries from electronics and cover the terminals with clear tape before recycling. Smart Phones, Laptops and Tablets Smart phones, laptops and tablets contain precious metals and should be recycled to minimize the need to mine these materials anew. Most <cover>cell phone carriers run programs that allow you to recycle your old device or donate it to someone in need if it still works — you can hand it over when you upgrade. Electronics stores like Best Buy also accept devices for recycling. Simply remove your SIM card from your phone and wipe any data from your device with a factory reset.</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 1190.000000 , \"title\": \"How to Dispose of Old Light Bulbs, Batteries & Other Household Items | Home Matters | AHS\" , \"url\": \"https://www.ahs.com/home-matters/quick-tips/how-to-dispose-of-old-bulbs-batteries-household-items/\" }"}}
