{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_861229317#8_1956793927","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of a dedicated guide on safely disposing of old computers and hardware. It directly states the steps: back up data, wipe the hard drive, then donate, resell, recycle, use local drop-off locations or retailer recycling/trade-in services, and consult professionals when sensitive data or regulations are involved.","learned":"Individuals can use municipal computer-recycling drop-offs, retailer recycling or trade-in services such as Staples, or professional pickup services after backing up data and wiping drives."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3604","reason":"The current query continues to return dedicated computer/electronics disposal guidance with concrete steps; continue while there may be more grade-3 results within the judgment budget."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3604"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_861229317#6_1956790785","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3604","rank":6,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_861229317#6_1956790785\" , \"end_char\": 3357.000000 , \"headings\": \"How to Dispose of Old Computers and Other Company Hardware How to Dispose of Old Computers and Other Company Hardware You’re ready to <cover>get rid of some old equipment. How can you do that safely? 1. Backup your data. 2. Wipe your hard drive. 3. Donate, resell, or recycle. Consult with a professional about regulatory standards. \" , \"segment\": \"3. Donate, resell, or recycle. You can’t just throw your computer </cover>away. There are various components within a computer that are either environmentally toxic, such as mercury and lead, or valuable, such as copper, aluminum, and gold. Because of this, there are many programs available to help take your old computers off your hands. If your computers are in good working order, consider donating them. Many charitable organizations specialize in providing used and refurbished computers to underfunded schools or families in need. You can also look into options to resell your old computers, if they’re still in good enough condition. If your hardware "}}
